</span><span id="lstnumberx32.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.55" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx32.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.57" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">time</span><span id="lstnumberx32.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.59" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">spent</span><span id="lstnumberx32.60" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.61" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">at</span><span id="lstnumberx32.62" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.63" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">each</span><span id="lstnumberx32.64" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx32.65" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">city.</span>
</div>
