class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx66.90" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx66.91" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx66.92" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx66.93" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">travel</span><span id="lstnumberx66.94" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx66.95" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">time.</span>
