<section id="S3.SS4.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">3. Prepending Feedback (Correction Scenario):</h4>

<div id="S3.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">When the generated itinerary is invalid or incorrectly formatted, feedback is prepended to the base prompt:</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST3" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST3.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,cHJvbXB0X3RvX3VzZSA9IGZlZWRiYWNrX21lc3NhZ2UgKyBiYXNlX3Byb21wdA==" download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx70" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx70.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">prompt_to_use</span><span id="lstnumberx70.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx70.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">=</span><span id="lstnumberx70.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx70.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">feedback_message</span><span id="lstnumberx70.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx70.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">+</span><span id="lstnumberx70.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx70.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">base_prompt</span>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 3: </span>Prepending feedback in correction scenarios.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS4.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">a. JSON formatting error</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST4" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST4.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx71" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx71.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">feedback_message</span><span id="lstnumberx71.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx71.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">=</span><span id="lstnumberx71.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx71.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_string ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">""</span><span id="lstnumberx71.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_string ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF8040;">"The<span id="lstnumberx71.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>previous<span id="lstnumberx71.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>response<span id="lstnumberx71.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>was<span id="lstnumberx71.6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>not<span id="lstnumberx71.6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>a<span id="lstnumberx71.6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>valid<span id="lstnumberx71.6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>JSON<span id="lstnumberx71.6.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>object.<span id="lstnumberx71.6.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>Please<span id="lstnumberx71.6.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>ensure:</span>
</div>
