<br class="ltx_break">Depart: 2025-06-08 06:00 
<br class="ltx_break">[Minimum stay violation (20h)]</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S5.T2.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Arrive: 2025-06-07 10:00 
<br class="ltx_break">Depart: 2025-06-09 10:00 
<br class="ltx_break">[2-day stay enforced]</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Frankfurt (FRA)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Arrive: 2025-06-08 18:00 
<br class="ltx_break">Depart: 2025-06-11 04:00 
<br class="ltx_break">[Too short transit from SYD (12h vs req. 21h)]</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
