<br class="ltx_break">[Too long FRA<math id="S5.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>CAI transit]</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
