</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="S5.T2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Casablanca (CMN)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
